4 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408187 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408189 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408190 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1077 "selection" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1079 #edb/ref 17592186408189 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408191 1080 #uuid "15e1383f-1b6d-5090-8b4e-e602188986c5" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408171 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408172 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408178 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408185 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408186 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1077 "selection" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1079 #edb/ref 17592186408186 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408192 1080 #uuid "529d609f-c755-5038-98fc-5e940ab6a79a" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408179 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408180 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408181 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408182 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408183 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1077 "selection" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1079 #edb/ref 17592186408179 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408193 1080 #uuid "9a398de2-1cab-5e15-93f0-5e8dde00197f" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408174 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408175 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408176 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408177 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186408188 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1077 "selection" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1079 #edb/ref 17592186408174 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408194 1080 #uuid "eb0ebf0b-554c-514b-a72c-5d817e3dd52a" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408195 1068 #edb/ref 17592186408193 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408195 1069 "q-111046" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408195 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408195 1071 "The matrix $D$ and the vector $b$ are given below.\nDetermine if $b\\in \\text{Col}(D).$ \nIn the affirmative case, find the value of ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}+{x}_{4}$, where ${x}_{1}$, ${x}_{2}$, ${x}_{3}$, and ${x}_{4}$ are real numbers such that $b={x}_{1}{d}_{1}+{x}_{2}{d}_{2}+{x}_{3}{d}_{3}+{x}_{4}{d}_{4},$ and ${d}_{1}$, ${d}_{2}$, ${d}_{3}$, and ${d}_{4}$ are respective columns of $D.$\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 6 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 5 & -1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408195 1072 #uuid "06040e86-0928-550a-a9a4-3db2bc9e2e31" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408195 1074 "In order to determine whether $b$ lies in $\\text{Col}(D),$ we need to check if the equation $Dx=b$ is consistent. So, let's find the row echelon form of the augmented matrix $[D\\,|\\,b]$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[D\\,|\\,b] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 6 & 4 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 5 & -1 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 5 & -1 & 6\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we have the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}-2{x}_{4}=1 \\\\ 0=6 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}+{x}_{4}=-8 \\\\ {x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3}-{x}_{4}=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the  second equation, we get a false statement $0=6.$ Therefore, the system is inconsistent, and we conclude that $b\\notin \\text{Col}(D).$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408196 1068 #edb/ref 17592186408192 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408196 1069 "q-34503" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408196 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408196 1071 "The matrix $K$ and the vector $b$ are given below. Determine if $b\\in \\text{Col}(K).$ In the affirmative case, find the value of ${x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2},$ where ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}$ are real numbers such that $b={x}_{1}{k}_{1}+{x}_{2}{k}_{2},$ and ${k}_{1},$ ${k}_{2}$ are the respective columns of $K.$\n\n$$\nK=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408196 1072 #uuid "0a92dafd-51fb-510b-93ec-662d06afe5a3" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408196 1074 "In order to determine whether $b$ lies in $\\text{Col}(K),$ we need to check if the equation $Kx=b$ is consistent. So, let's find the row echelon form of the augmented matrix $[K\\,|\\,b]$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[K\\,|\\,b] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -8 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -8 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-4{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -8 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -18\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we have the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2}=4 \\\\ {x}_{2}=5 \\\\ 0=-18.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get the false statement $0=-18.$ \n\nTherefore, the system is inconsistent, which implies that $b\\notin \\text{Col}(K).$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408197 1068 #edb/ref 17592186408194 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408197 1069 "q-74221" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408197 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408197 1071 "The matrix $A$ and the vector $b$ are given below.\nDetermine if $b\\in \\text{Col}(A).$ \nIn the affirmative case, find the value of ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}$, where ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ and ${x}_{3}$ are real numbers such that $b={x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3},$ and ${a}_{1}$, ${a}_{2}$, and ${a}_{3}$ are the respective columns of $A.$\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 10 & -7 \\\\ 3 & -12 & 10\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 11 \\\\ -13\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408197 1072 #uuid "2009c6af-efbe-5caf-a9f3-bb999b290a0f" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408197 1074 "In order to determine whether $b$ lies in $\\text{Col}(A),$ we need to check if the equation $Ax=b$ is consistent. So, let's find the row echelon form of the augmented matrix $[A\\,|\\,b]$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[A\\,|\\,b] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 10 & -7 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -12 & 10 & -13\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -12 & 10 & -13\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we have the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-4{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3}=-4 \\\\ 2{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=3 \\\\ {x}_{3}=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-1.$ Substituting it into the second equation gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{2}-(-1) & =3 \\\\ 2{x}_{2} & =2 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, from the first equation, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =-4+4{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} \\\\  & =-4+4(1)-3(-1) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince we have a solution, the equation $Ax=b$ is consistent, which implies that $b\\in \\text{Col}(A).$ \n\nMoreover, there is exactly one solution, so we have exactly one way to write $b$ as a linear combination of ${a}_{1},$ ${a}_{2},$ and ${a}_{3}:$\n\n$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 11 \\\\ -13\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{b}=3\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{1}}+1\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{2}}+(-1)\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{3}}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=3+1+(-1)=3.$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408198 1068 #edb/ref 17592186408191 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408198 1069 "q-110975" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408198 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408198 1071 "Consider the matrix given by $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{aligned}].$ Determine the value of $k$ for which the vector $b=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ k+5\\end{aligned}]$ belongs to $\\text{Col}(A).$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408198 1072 #uuid "5304c962-1643-582f-be3c-68ed826e56d6" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true] [17592186408198 1074 "If $b$ lies in $\\text{Col}(A),$ then the equation $Ax=b$ must be consistent. So, let's find the row echelon form of the augmented matrix $[A\\,|\\,b]$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[A\\,|\\,b] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 7 & -2 & k+5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-7{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 5 & k+40\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-5{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & k+30\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=-5 \\\\ {x}_{2}=2 \\\\ 0=k+30.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn order for this system to be consistent, we require $0=k+30,$ which means that $k=-30.$" 13194139533564 17592186045585 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0e09706e-9bae-5390-a4c8-454afb7bdba9" 17592186408171 "answer-310c69d2-39ad-5656-a9df-2348bfbcfc3d" 17592186408172 "answer-3f479d1d-5d75-5f3c-8153-6a84de5b7ca8" 17592186408173 "answer-4543a202-3ccc-5eab-b11e-9acd9fffb1d8" 17592186408174 "answer-47160327-abda-5117-a3f6-534dafb7314d" 17592186408175 "answer-49158a7c-f7b1-5aa2-a277-f0ac8325fc0b" 17592186408176 "answer-56c7eda1-7b63-555c-9f5f-b736c9f51e0b" 17592186408177 "answer-676b432f-8135-5f04-aa24-f35508646c7d" 17592186408178 "answer-78645ea0-f8bd-5f81-bf27-fac8caad6e9c" 17592186408179 "answer-7acd09aa-e693-553d-8659-2bccadf0cd4f" 17592186408180 "answer-a9c33b38-1f8c-54fe-a1a1-31dc93958a1a" 17592186408181 "answer-af5fd598-f27a-56c8-bd28-250a38b55ee9" 17592186408182 "answer-b263cee4-a3ad-5f42-875f-5cc9d7a2c77d" 17592186408183 "answer-be5b0ebc-829b-5a60-838a-1ec9ecacfa60" 17592186408184 "answer-c34b20ad-6cc0-5427-81db-158ceccf5944" 17592186408185 "answer-cdc0656a-82ba-50bd-b21a-9c93190c767d" 17592186408186 "answer-ec6eff0c-554b-5fe5-937d-c0a3c886c493" 17592186408187 "answer-fa79a18c-e454-55de-b1b8-442bf38cb930" 17592186408188 "answer-fb94d986-309a-566f-aca1-f08bcb7d0e0c" 17592186408189 "answer-fe6f84ec-14e8-58fa-9f02-c1ec2a769c5e" 17592186408190 "answer-field-15e1383f-1b6d-5090-8b4e-e602188986c5" 17592186408191 "answer-field-529d609f-c755-5038-98fc-5e940ab6a79a" 17592186408192 "answer-field-9a398de2-1cab-5e15-93f0-5e8dde00197f" 17592186408193 "answer-fiel